    <briefdescription>
<para>2D texture wrapper for OpenGL textures. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Loads images from files (using stb_image) and manages the OpenGL texture object. Supports wrapping modes (GL_REPEAT) and mipmap generation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Textures are loaded with vertical flip enabled (stbi_set_flip_vertically_on_load). </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classResourceManager" kindref="compound">ResourceManager</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
